---
title: Fix the unexpected change
description: Live specimen. Stop focus and input from navigating, then Apply. Leftover failures name the child rule to restudy.
node: no-unexpected-change-fix
layout: practice
practice: fix
of: no-unexpected-change
check_rules:
  - no-change-on-focus
  - no-change-on-input
practice_note: Focus and changing a value must not navigate. Keep the same control, then Apply. What still fails is what to restudy.
